distinction.  I have met VERY few people that would say that killing people
indiscriminately is not wrong.  But I encounter people on a daily basis that
will tell you, with their bare face hanging out, that homosexuality IS WRONG,
that dressing like a wierdo IS WRONG, that hanging out with themthere niggers
and spics IS WRONG, that taking drugs IS WRONG.  This seems very much akin
to a menu/meal confusion, but not quite the same.  As it is the entire reason
